          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Various components for heating system
Production of various components for heating systems;
UUID: 16e37c74-6ceb-3a46-bb55-c6e280e75e4b
Materials used for the production. Energy use for the different production steps. Transport of raw materials to the plant.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Typical technology, materials and components used for pipe installations of heating systems in appartment and commercial buildings
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Manufacturer informations and literature data. Data of typical products used. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_16e37c74-6ceb-3a46-bb55-c6e280e75e4b.xml</text>
